(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-61","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["岛站的导览很[[imaginative|富有想象力]]，用[[penguin|企鹅]]模型迎客，把白塔称作援助的[[masterpiece|杰作]]。讲解员对游客很[[tolerant|宽容]]，一见我们却要[[dispatch|派遣]]人送去旅店，说岛上[[interpersonal|人际]]关系紧密，站长是[[exemplary|模范的]]人物，不必乱问。我指向停工名单上的[[layoff|裁员]]记录，问那几位还能否在场。墙角一名[[wretched|愁苦的]]维修员抬起头，觉得说没有人记得旧货太[[absurd|荒谬]]。他不是来欢迎我们的，只是回来取最后一箱个人工具，门卫还不肯让他上楼。","他的[[modesty|谦逊]]不是不知道事情，而是不愿借塔的[[glamor|魅力]]抬高自己。在人群[[midst|中间]]，他指认白塔门口一块补漆的[[trait|特征]]：警戒[[radius|半径范围]]内旧箱曾露天放置，纸签已有[[disintegration|破裂]]。导览牌上的[[dolphin|海豚]]研究属后来的项目，[[thereafter|之后]]旧货就都被叫作生态援助。这里不是没有危险的[[paradise|乐园]]。老陈低头看门的[[hinge|铰链]]，发现更换过的插销只适合从内扣住；我们仍按登记流程进门，不把一扇旧门当成随意闯入的理由。","塔内[[telecommunications|通信]]记录可校准[[ferry|渡船]]时刻，墙上有南北[[hemisphere|半球]]的海流图。讲解员希望我们[[applaud|鼓掌赞许]]布展，我却因着急显得[[arrogant|傲慢]]，说自己不是来当[[idiot|傻子]]。程雾把我拉到一旁，先请对方[[relay|转达]]查档申请，不准我[[solo|独自]]冲进仓库。旧库[[adjoin|毗连]]观测间，门内是一股[[overwhelming|浓烈的]]油味。讲解员被我伤了脸，还是给出公开存货页。我向她说刚才不该那样讲话，询问维修员能否带我们看交货区域，她点头时没有再笑。","维修员并不[[muscular|强壮]]，抱起工具却很熟练。塔站拿他的照片印书，[[royalty|版税]]一分钱也没给，他不[[relish|享受]]所谓出名。我们跟他沿草[[stalk|茎]]杂生的小径走，灶房正[[brew|冲泡]]茶，天边风声像正在酝酿一场[[menace|威胁]]。厨工把茶递来[[appease|安抚]]大家，老陈将水槽里的[[sieve|筛子]]移开，发现可[[whereby|借此]]识别箱轮的旧压痕。并无[[instantaneous|即刻的]]破案，只有具体的方向：货曾从塔后经过，不是导览所指的游客门。","维修员有一套[[quarterly|季度的]]工具清点照，B-17旧箱总在同一个角落[[recur|重现]]。我不愿从几张照片[[generalize|概括推断]]所有货物；一株[[dwarf|矮小的]]棕榈旁，箱底[[grease|润滑脂]]的缺口却每次相同。站长[[allege|宣称]]援助货只到过正门，又说游客像[[pilgrim|朝圣者]]一样尊敬塔，不该被我们搅乱。程雾没有让他的话[[trigger|引发]]争吵，她正尝试[[assimilate|消化]]各处时刻，把公开目录和实验存货[[segregate|分开]]。老陈在照片旁写出实际路径，维修员第一次不用靠提高嗓门才能把事情说完整。","暮色里我们得到入库簿的查看许可，但柜里只剩新标签。登记册的白塔章能证实曾经接样，却不能补出原批次。维修员带来的工具照露出旧博物馆专用纸袋，程雾放大后读到馆藏移交日期，比站长说的到货时间早三个月。他解释那是捐赠纪念物，我们问同一木箱为何又在退样照片里。门外的旗子已绷紧，轮渡广播提醒次日可能停航。我们住进岛上旅店，约好明早去旧博物馆查那只纸袋，而不让尚未落下的风替我们先决定一个答案。"],"en":["The station's [[imaginative|imaginative]] tour used a [[penguin|penguin]] model and called White Tower an aid [[masterpiece|masterpiece]]. Its [[tolerant|tolerant]] guide nevertheless offered to [[dispatch|dispatch]] us to a hotel: island [[interpersonal|interpersonal]] ties were close; its director was [[exemplary|exemplary]]. I asked about a [[layoff|layoff]] list. A [[wretched|wretched]] maintenance worker considered claims that nobody remembered old goods [[absurd|absurd]]. He had returned for personal tools, but guards still prevented him going upstairs.","His [[modesty|modesty]] concealed neither knowledge nor ambition for the tower's [[glamor|glamor]]. In our [[midst|midst]] he identified a painted-over [[trait|trait]] on the doorway. Within the safety [[radius|radius]], old boxes had stood outside, labels undergoing [[disintegration|disintegration]]. The [[dolphin|dolphin]] programme came later; [[thereafter|thereafter]] everything became ecological aid. This was no riskless [[paradise|paradise]]. Chen examined a replaced [[hinge|hinge]] and inward bolt. We still registered properly rather than treating an old door as permission to enter.","[[telecommunications|Telecommunications]] records could calibrate [[ferry|ferry]] times beneath a [[hemisphere|hemisphere]] current map. The guide wanted us to [[applaud|applaud]] displays. Impatient and [[arrogant|arrogant]], I said I was no [[idiot|idiot]]. Cheng intervened, requesting she [[relay|relay]] an archive application and preventing a [[solo|solo]] intrusion. A store would [[adjoin|adjoin]] observation rooms; an [[overwhelming|overwhelming]] oily smell escaped. Hurt, the guide still supplied public inventory. I apologized and asked whether the worker could show delivery areas. She nodded without smiling.","Though hardly [[muscular|muscular]], he handled tools easily. Books used his photograph without paying [[royalty|royalty]]; he did not [[relish|relish]] fame. We followed a path thick with grass [[stalk|stalks]] past tea being [[brew|brewed]]. Wind seemed a coming [[menace|menace]]. The cook offered cups to [[appease|appease]] us. Chen moved a drain [[sieve|sieve]], [[whereby|whereby]] old wheel marks became visible. There was no [[instantaneous|instantaneous]] solution. Cargo had passed behind the tower rather than through the visitors' entrance indicated on its tour.","[[quarterly|Quarterly]] tool photographs showed B-17 boxes [[recur|recur]] in one corner. I would not [[generalize|generalize]] all cargo from them. Beside a [[dwarf|dwarf]] palm, however, a missing patch of [[grease|grease]] matched repeatedly. The director continued to [[allege|allege]] front-door delivery, saying visitors respected the tower like a [[pilgrim|pilgrim]]. Cheng did not let this [[trigger|trigger]] argument. She sought to [[assimilate|assimilate]] times and [[segregate|segregate]] public catalogue entries from experimental stock. Chen mapped the route, allowing the worker to speak without shouting.","We gained permission to examine storage records, but found only new labels. The stamp confirmed sample reception, not original batches. Tool photographs revealed a museum paper bag whose transfer date preceded the claimed arrival by three months. The director called it a souvenir. Why did its box reappear among sample returns? Flags tightened outside; ferry warnings predicted cancellation. We took rooms and arranged to investigate the museum bag tomorrow, without allowing approaching weather to determine our answer first."]});
